## Astra Migration Center + local profiles

astra-migration-title = Bring your browser with you
astra-migration-subtitle = Import bookmarks, history, and passwords from another browser on this device

astra-migration-import-browser-data =
    .label = Import browser data
astra-migration-import-into-profile =
    .label = Import into this profile
astra-migration-appmenu =
    .label = Import browser data

astra-migration-destination =
    .value = Import destination

astra-migration-dest-current-profile =
    .label = Import into current profile
astra-migration-dest-new-profile =
    .label = Create a new profile

astra-migration-nonempty-warning =
    Importing into a profile that already has data may create duplicates. Native import does not roll back existing Astra data. Creating a new profile is recommended.

astra-migration-new-profile-handoff =
    A new Astra profile opens in a separate window. After it finishes setup, choose “Import browser data” there. Import does not start in this window.

astra-migration-native-wizard-note =
    The next step uses the built-in import wizard to choose the browser, profile, and data types.

astra-migration-privacy-note =
    Import changes this Astra profile on this device. Passwords may require a secure CSV export for some browsers. Astra does not upload your browser data.

astra-migration-private-blocked =
    Import and profile management are unavailable in private windows. Open a normal window to import browser data.

astra-migration-create-profile-failed =
    A new profile could not be created. You can still import into the current profile, or open Manage profiles.

astra-migration-password-csv-warning =
    Some browsers require a password CSV export. The file contains sensitive data. Do not share it, and securely delete it after import. Astra does not keep the file path.

